{"text": " in as measured a way as possible, because I think being radical is a privilege. I think that's something that people don't always realise. I don't think as a black or ethnic minority person, you can be radical, and there won't be consequences to that. So what you always have to engage in is this kind of call intellect, this measured kind of radical approach, if you will, because you don't have the luxury of just kind of sitting there and just saying what you want. And I got a banana in a post. That wasn't even that long ago, that was like November. They got a banana in a gift bag. And I remember explaining this to students. And so they addressed it to work. And I remember thinking, like, I said to the students, think about that as a process, right? You can't fit a banana in a post box. So you would have to go to the post office. You'd get it weighed. They would ask you what's in the bag. You'd say a banana. They'd probably be quite bemused. You'd send it by recorded delivery, because, or special delivery, because you've got to, because it can't go in. You know, anything.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.26, "text": " in as measured a way as possible,", "tokens": [50363, 287, 355, 8630, 257, 835, 355, 1744, 11, 50426], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.1775032912983614, "compression_ratio": 1.7849462365591398, "no_speech_prob": 0.030787795782089233}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 1.26, "end": 4.88, "text": " because I think being radical is a privilege.", "tokens": [50426, 780, 314, 892, 852, 7702, 318, 257, 11941, 13, 50607], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.1775032912983614, "compression_ratio": 1.7849462365591398, "no_speech_prob": 0.030787795782089233}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 4.88, "end": 7.78, "text": " I think that's something that people don't always realise.", "tokens": [50607, 314, 892, 326, 338, 1223, 326, 661, 836, 470, 1464, 18996, 13, 50752], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.1775032912983614, "compressi